== A3: formula (c) vs direct definition; finiteness criterion (b); radial limit (a)
  finite 4508, infinite 1024, criterion mismatches 0, max rel |formula(c) - direct| = 1.50e-12, radial-limit rel diff (t=1e-9) = 2.48e-06
  interior contrasts: max rel |c^T L^+ c - sum c^2/s - formula(c)| = 1.38e-10
== A4: superadditivity 1/V(s+t) >= 1/V(s) + 1/V(t) on the closed orthant (1/inf = 0)
  7431 pairs, max relative violation (I(s)+I(t)-I(s+t))/I(s+t) = 4.15e-14
